+		// If in a search app (Raycast/Spotlight), an inline prediction might be highlighted.
+		// If we send Backspace, it deletes the highlight, throwing off our backspace count.
+		// Typing a comma (',') replaces any highlighted text with a single comma.
+		// Then we just add 1 to our deleteCount to delete the comma too!
